1
00:01:37,860 --> 00:01:42,920
=Ren Yu=
(Adapted from Lei Mi's novel Ren Yu)

2
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:46,040
=Episode 14=

3
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:49,070
Vincent!

4
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:51,710
Look! I found some money.

5
00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:53,230
I found this wallet.

6
00:01:53,350 --> 00:01:54,680
Now we can buy a thermos.

7
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:55,760
Then we won't...

8
00:01:56,590 --> 00:01:57,590
Then...

9
00:02:11,420 --> 00:02:14,830
(Hongqi Theater)

10
00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:17,000
(Theater Entrance)

11
00:02:33,420 --> 00:02:37,900
(Theater)

12
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,400
What do we do, Vincent?

13
00:03:01,750 --> 00:03:02,280
Mom.

14
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:06,560
You asleep?

15
00:03:07,430 --> 00:03:08,150
No.

16
00:03:09,470 --> 00:03:10,310
Can't sleep?

17
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,470
Thinking about tomorrow,

18
00:03:17,030 --> 00:03:18,120
I'm kind of...

19
00:03:19,310 --> 00:03:20,000
Nervous？

20
00:03:24,470 --> 00:03:25,240
Don't be.

21
00:03:26,710 --> 00:03:27,870
It's no big deal.

22
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:28,960
I'm right here.

23
00:03:30,030 --> 00:03:31,280
I'm always here for you.

24
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:38,000
Mom.

25
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:43,150
We haven't shared a bed in forever.

26
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:48,520
You're a big girl now.

27
00:03:53,310 --> 00:03:54,080
Get some sleep.

28
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:56,360
Okay.

29
00:04:14,710 --> 00:04:15,800
I, Ma Dongchen,

30
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,600
make this offering today

31
00:04:18,190 --> 00:04:19,310
and invite the Buddha home.

32
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,160
May the Buddha

33
00:04:21,510 --> 00:04:23,040
keep my daughter Na

34
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:24,750
safe and sound.

35
00:04:43,310 --> 00:04:45,070
Wasn't I clear?

36
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:48,480
Get Gu out of Chaobei for a while.

37
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:49,720
Right.

38
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:51,560
Sure.

39
00:04:52,270 --> 00:04:53,680
Send him to security training.

40
00:04:53,830 --> 00:04:55,560
Fine. Whatever it costs.

41
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:56,830
Handle it.

42
00:05:07,310 --> 00:05:08,000
Dongchen!

43
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:09,950
Dongchen! You okay?

44
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:11,920
What happened?

45
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,070
Buddha, please

46
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:26,120
keep my daughter Na safe.

47
00:05:31,830 --> 00:05:33,600
Train a security company?

48
00:05:34,390 --> 00:05:35,390
I can't do that.

49
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:37,830
And I leave today?

50
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:39,240
Where?

51
00:05:40,510 --> 00:05:41,160
Out of town?

52
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:42,680
No way.

53
00:05:42,950 --> 00:05:44,360
I have things to deal with here.

54
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,630
Don't hang up.

55
00:05:50,430 --> 00:05:51,000
Coming!

56
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:55,120
Why are you here?

57
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:56,830
I'm on the phone.

58
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:00,480
Go on.

59
00:06:02,750 --> 00:06:04,240
I'm about to retire.

60
00:06:04,270 --> 00:06:05,920
What do I need all that money for?

61
00:06:06,390 --> 00:06:07,040
Who is it?

62
00:06:07,430 --> 00:06:09,800
Xu Changming. Wants me out of town.

63
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,600
I'd like to know

64
00:06:12,870 --> 00:06:15,360
what security firm wants me so bad.

65
00:06:17,630 --> 00:06:18,160
Hello?

66
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:19,270
Xu.

67
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:20,630
Du Qian here.

68
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:23,480
Gu had a checkup recently.

69
00:06:23,510 --> 00:06:24,950
He needs to be hospitalized.

70
00:06:25,070 --> 00:06:26,120
He can't go anywhere.

71
00:06:26,630 --> 00:06:27,070
Right.

72
00:06:27,510 --> 00:06:29,000
I'm here to take care of him.

73
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,310
He's got no one else.

74
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,510
All right. That's it.

75
00:06:35,830 --> 00:06:36,750
See? Done.

76
00:06:38,390 --> 00:06:38,870
Thanks.

77
00:06:39,870 --> 00:06:40,920
Thanks for that.

78
00:06:42,630 --> 00:06:44,160
You looked shocked when I came in.

79
00:06:44,190 --> 00:06:45,430
Forget what we're doing today?

80
00:06:45,830 --> 00:06:46,480
Checkup.

81
00:06:46,870 --> 00:06:47,680
Like I'd forget.

82
00:06:48,310 --> 00:06:48,830
Let's go.

83
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:49,720
No, wait.

84
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:50,950
I can't.

85
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:52,680
We said we'd get you checked.

86
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:53,560
Waiting for someone.

87
00:06:55,390 --> 00:06:55,920
They're here.

88
00:07:02,830 --> 00:07:03,360
They're here.

89
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:04,510
- Come on in.
- Mr. Gu.

90
00:07:04,560 --> 00:07:05,270
Come in.

91
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:06,070
Come in.

92
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:07,390
Go ahead.

93
00:07:08,510 --> 00:07:09,040
Uh.

94
00:07:11,190 --> 00:07:11,830
Maybe

95
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:13,430
we should come back later.

96
00:07:13,630 --> 00:07:15,040
No, it's fine.

97
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,070
Come in.

98
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:17,800
Jiang Ting, come in.

99
00:07:17,950 --> 00:07:18,950
Let me introduce you.

100
00:07:19,310 --> 00:07:19,720
Come in.

101
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:21,510
Have a seat.

102
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:23,600
This

103
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:24,560
is

104
00:07:24,950 --> 00:07:26,830
my friend, Ms. Jiang.

105
00:07:27,190 --> 00:07:28,560
This is her daughter, Jiang Ting.

106
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:30,750
She's at Su Lin's school.

107
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:33,920
This is another friend,

108
00:07:34,270 --> 00:07:35,040
Ms. Du.

109
00:07:37,310 --> 00:07:38,040
Hi, Ms. Du.

110
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,430
Have a seat.

111
00:07:40,630 --> 00:07:40,950
Come on.

112
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:41,360
Sit.

113
00:07:43,950 --> 00:07:44,830
Thank you.

114
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:52,240
Ting.

115
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:54,120
Your mom said

116
00:07:54,510 --> 00:07:55,720
you had something to tell me.

117
00:07:56,270 --> 00:07:57,040
What is it?

118
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:03,830
Mr. Gu,

119
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:06,310
where does Su Lin live?

120
00:08:06,870 --> 00:08:07,600
Right next door.

121
00:08:08,510 --> 00:08:09,120
Then maybe

122
00:08:09,510 --> 00:08:10,480
let's talk at her place.

123
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:14,510
Okay.

124
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:23,920
This is Su Lin's.

125
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,240
Su!

126
00:08:29,070 --> 00:08:29,870
Mrs. Su!

127
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:33,790
No answer.

128
00:08:34,270 --> 00:08:35,120
They must be out.

129
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,200
Let's wait at my place.

130
00:08:44,150 --> 00:08:44,670
Ting.

131
00:09:10,550 --> 00:09:11,550
I want to try.

132
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:17,150
It's Su Lin's.

133
00:10:17,390 --> 00:10:18,440
It's okay.

134
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,840
It's okay. Don't be scared.

135
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:25,150
Don't cry.

136
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:27,200
It's okay.

137
00:10:28,550 --> 00:10:29,960
Don't be scared.

138
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:32,510
It's okay.

139
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:34,910
It's Su Lin's.

140
00:10:49,390 --> 00:10:50,870
So you found this key

141
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:53,440
down in that drain?

142
00:10:55,630 --> 00:10:58,390
Where is that drain?

143
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:02,670
Right below my home.

144
00:11:03,510 --> 00:11:04,960
Near the flower bed.

145
00:11:06,670 --> 00:11:07,790
I keep thinking

146
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:11,840
Su Lin might come out of there.

147
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,630
You're a good kid.

148
00:11:20,750 --> 00:11:21,960
No, I'm not.

149
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:25,600
I should've said something right away.

150
00:11:26,870 --> 00:11:28,000
This isn't your fault.

151
00:11:31,030 --> 00:11:31,670
Mr. Gu,

152
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:34,440
I need to make one thing clear.

153
00:11:35,790 --> 00:11:36,440
My daughter

154
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:38,320
witnessed what happened.

155
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:39,440
And she wanted

156
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:42,000
the Sus to know everything.

157
00:11:42,790 --> 00:11:44,200
But at this point,

158
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,670
we've done all we can.

159
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:48,720
Whatever they do next,

160
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:51,200
we don't want to be involved.

161
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:56,320
I mean,

162
00:11:56,670 --> 00:11:58,550
whatever happens from here,

163
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:01,510
keep her out of it.

164
00:12:01,870 --> 00:12:02,390
I understand.

165
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:04,240
Completely.

166
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:06,360
She still has school.

167
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:07,750
This can't

168
00:12:07,790 --> 00:12:09,240
mess up her life.

169
00:12:17,270 --> 00:12:17,870
Okay?

170
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:18,960
It has to be.

171
00:12:20,030 --> 00:12:20,440
Let's go.

172
00:12:21,150 --> 00:12:21,960
Give me the key.

173
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:23,510
The Sus are back.

174
00:12:25,030 --> 00:12:26,000
You're not pushing me?

175
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:27,840
Go yourself. I'll take the cane.

176
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:31,000
There are clothes in the cabinet

177
00:12:31,030 --> 00:12:31,870
I didn't grab.

178
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:33,750
I know. I'll take what I can.

179
00:12:33,750 --> 00:12:34,630
Hurry up.

180
00:12:35,750 --> 00:12:36,270
They're back.

181
00:12:37,870 --> 00:12:38,440
Ting.

182
00:12:45,150 --> 00:12:45,840
Ting.

183
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:51,360
Ting.

184
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:54,030
You ready?

185
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:22,000
(Theater Entrance)

186
00:13:31,870 --> 00:13:32,750
What do we do?

187
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:34,720
Why hasn't shown up?

188
00:13:37,270 --> 00:13:38,480
Let's go to the police.

189
00:13:54,150 --> 00:13:55,360
You got it all wrong.

190
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:58,200
Su Lin went back home.

191
00:13:59,750 --> 00:14:00,510
Please leave.

192
00:14:01,630 --> 00:14:03,000
I can't see you out like this.

193
00:14:06,270 --> 00:14:07,670
What are you standing there for?

194
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:09,870
Pack up. We're leaving.

195
00:14:11,150 --> 00:14:11,750
Su.

196
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:14,910
You think she's lying?

197
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:16,790
She found your house key

198
00:14:16,870 --> 00:14:18,150
in a drain by the towel factory.

199
00:14:18,390 --> 00:14:19,790
It's your key.

200
00:14:20,150 --> 00:14:21,440
So what?

201
00:14:22,630 --> 00:14:24,600
Coincidences happen.

202
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:33,390
We found this

203
00:14:33,390 --> 00:14:34,440
in the grass downstairs.

204
00:14:34,910 --> 00:14:35,510
Look.

205
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:55,240
Honey.

206
00:14:56,960 --> 00:14:57,670
Honey.

207
00:15:01,510 --> 00:15:02,960
It's Lin's.

208
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:07,390
It's Lin's!

209
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:28,550
Why didn't you tell us sooner?

210
00:15:29,750 --> 00:15:31,480
And now you show up?

211
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:33,870
It's been days.

212
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:36,510
Now you wanna play hero?

213
00:15:37,480 --> 00:15:39,840
Your kid was the one being bullied.

214
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:42,080
We came here to tell you.

215
00:15:42,670 --> 00:15:44,030
You don't have to thank us,

216
00:15:44,150 --> 00:15:46,030
but don't start yelling at us.

217
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:48,550
Don't tell me what to do.

218
00:15:48,750 --> 00:15:49,910
This is my house.

219
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:50,750
Honey.

220
00:15:50,790 --> 00:15:52,510
We have to find Lin!

221
00:15:52,510 --> 00:15:53,390
- Honey!
- Shut up!

222
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:56,910
One more word, I'll break your legs.

223
00:15:57,150 --> 00:15:57,790
Su.

224
00:15:59,030 --> 00:15:59,960
That's way out of line.

225
00:16:01,910 --> 00:16:02,870
I'm out of line?

226
00:16:04,240 --> 00:16:05,080
Gu.

227
00:16:06,150 --> 00:16:08,150
I call you Mr. Gu out of respect.

228
00:16:09,510 --> 00:16:10,960
We've been neighbors for years.

229
00:16:11,960 --> 00:16:12,960
Have I ever crossed you?

230
00:16:13,510 --> 00:16:14,720
What's that supposed to mean?

231
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:17,120
Stay out of my family's business!

232
00:16:18,270 --> 00:16:21,000
This has nothing to do with you!

233
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:23,240
She is my friend.

234
00:16:23,390 --> 00:16:25,270
Are you her father? Did you raise her?

235
00:16:25,790 --> 00:16:27,390
You bring two strangers over

236
00:16:27,510 --> 00:16:29,120
to poke around my house,

237
00:16:29,510 --> 00:16:30,870
talking all this nonsense.

238
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:33,000
You think I won't fight back?

239
00:16:34,390 --> 00:16:35,390
Get out!

240
00:16:35,390 --> 00:16:36,360
All of you, out!

241
00:16:36,440 --> 00:16:36,870
Out!

242
00:16:36,910 --> 00:16:37,720
Let's go.

243
00:16:38,080 --> 00:16:39,030
My place. Come on.

244
00:17:11,350 --> 00:17:12,400
My family's business

245
00:17:13,030 --> 00:17:14,030
is none of yours.

246
00:17:40,240 --> 00:17:41,440
He's unbelievable.

247
00:17:41,880 --> 00:17:43,480
I've never seen a parent like that.

248
00:17:43,960 --> 00:17:44,960
His kid's missing,

249
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:46,240
and he won't look.

250
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:47,590
He just yells

251
00:17:47,880 --> 00:17:48,960
at both of us.

252
00:17:49,110 --> 00:17:49,750
Calm down.

253
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:51,920
What does he take us for?

254
00:17:52,030 --> 00:17:53,030
Sit down.

255
00:17:53,480 --> 00:17:54,000
Don't be mad.

256
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:02,030
I didn't expect

257
00:18:02,510 --> 00:18:03,350
any of that today.

258
00:18:04,110 --> 00:18:05,240
Sorry you got dragged in.

259
00:18:05,920 --> 00:18:07,110
Jiang, I owe you an apology.

260
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:08,110
It's not your fault.

261
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:17,960
Thanks.

262
00:18:23,750 --> 00:18:24,480
Thank you, Ms. Du.

263
00:18:29,200 --> 00:18:29,920
Honestly,

264
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:32,880
the Sus

265
00:18:33,310 --> 00:18:34,640
have a lot going on.

266
00:18:35,200 --> 00:18:36,400
Whatever they're dealing with,

267
00:18:36,510 --> 00:18:38,270
they can't just ignore their kid.

268
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:40,270
Everyone has their scars.

269
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:43,160
We may never understand

270
00:18:45,720 --> 00:18:47,200
other people's problems.

271
00:18:51,720 --> 00:18:52,480
Mr. Gu.

272
00:18:55,790 --> 00:18:56,920
can we

273
00:18:59,270 --> 00:19:01,160
still find Su Lin?

274
00:19:03,350 --> 00:19:03,960
Ting,

275
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:08,640
you found a tiny little key.

276
00:19:10,270 --> 00:19:11,400
Su Lin's a whole person.

277
00:19:12,510 --> 00:19:13,590
We'll find her.

278
00:19:14,720 --> 00:19:15,240
Don't worry.

279
00:19:15,750 --> 00:19:16,750
I'll call the police.

280
00:19:17,030 --> 00:19:18,030
This is all my fault.

281
00:19:20,240 --> 00:19:21,680
I was too slow to catch on.

282
00:19:23,880 --> 00:19:25,750
When I saw them dragging her around,

283
00:19:27,310 --> 00:19:28,160
I should've

284
00:19:28,830 --> 00:19:30,160
searched the garden more.

285
00:19:30,270 --> 00:19:32,070
The manhole was just steps away.

286
00:19:33,790 --> 00:19:34,590
At the very least,

287
00:19:35,790 --> 00:19:37,480
after seeing Ting like this,

288
00:19:37,550 --> 00:19:39,550
I should've known something was wrong.

289
00:19:39,960 --> 00:19:40,510
It's okay.

290
00:19:41,030 --> 00:19:42,030
Let's drop it.

291
00:19:44,830 --> 00:19:45,960
We'll find her.

292
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:50,240
You've done a lot.

293
00:19:52,030 --> 00:19:53,480
You're not even family,

294
00:19:54,270 --> 00:19:55,240
just neighbors,

295
00:19:56,440 --> 00:19:59,550
yet you care this much.

296
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:02,480
I know the girl.

297
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:05,000
You'd never met Su Lin,

298
00:20:06,240 --> 00:20:07,160
but you still helped.

299
00:20:07,880 --> 00:20:08,960
That's something.

300
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:10,640
Thank you.

301
00:20:11,400 --> 00:20:12,070
For what?

302
00:20:12,750 --> 00:20:13,880
I haven't done anything.

303
00:20:15,680 --> 00:20:17,270
Finding her is what matters.

304
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:19,270
Ting,

305
00:20:20,750 --> 00:20:22,640
say goodbye.

306
00:20:23,720 --> 00:20:24,720
Bye, Mr. Gu.

307
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:26,960
Bye, Ms. Du.

308
00:20:33,790 --> 00:20:34,510
Mr. Gu.

309
00:20:41,680 --> 00:20:42,200
What?

310
00:20:43,310 --> 00:20:44,070
As for this,

311
00:20:46,310 --> 00:20:47,400
we've done

312
00:20:48,070 --> 00:20:49,350
all we can.

313
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:50,680
She

314
00:20:51,310 --> 00:20:52,590
got it off her chest,

315
00:20:53,680 --> 00:20:55,400
and I did my part too.

316
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:58,640
Like we agreed,

317
00:20:59,350 --> 00:21:00,960
whatever the Sus do,

318
00:21:01,480 --> 00:21:02,640
that's their business.

319
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:04,830
We don't want to get involved.

320
00:21:05,720 --> 00:21:06,270
Of course.

321
00:21:07,160 --> 00:21:08,790
You've already helped a lot.

322
00:21:12,830 --> 00:21:13,350
Ting.

323
00:21:16,070 --> 00:21:16,920
Don't worry.

324
00:21:17,830 --> 00:21:19,720
Leave finding Su Lin to me.

325
00:21:20,510 --> 00:21:21,880
I've got nothing else going on.

326
00:21:22,750 --> 00:21:23,790
I'll figure something out.

327
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:29,440
If you find her,

328
00:21:30,030 --> 00:21:31,510
please let us know.

329
00:21:32,110 --> 00:21:32,590
Of course.

330
00:21:43,310 --> 00:21:44,200
Bye, Ting.

331
00:21:45,070 --> 00:21:45,960
Bye, Jiang.

332
00:22:39,070 --> 00:22:39,640
Ting.

333
00:22:42,110 --> 00:22:43,720
Maybe I could take the day off,

334
00:22:43,920 --> 00:22:44,830
and we go see a movie?

335
00:22:46,590 --> 00:22:47,350
A movie?

336
00:22:48,640 --> 00:22:50,680
You always say they're too long.

337
00:22:50,720 --> 00:22:51,480
You hate movies.

338
00:22:52,270 --> 00:22:53,400
Maybe there's one

339
00:22:53,720 --> 00:22:54,750
I want to see.

340
00:22:55,750 --> 00:22:56,310
Come on.

341
00:22:58,070 --> 00:22:59,830
I don't feel like a movie today.

342
00:23:01,640 --> 00:23:03,310
Then let's get cake.

343
00:23:09,830 --> 00:23:11,480
You don't get many days off.

344
00:23:12,200 --> 00:23:13,960
Whatever you want, I'm in.

345
00:23:17,480 --> 00:23:19,200
I want you to go to work.

346
00:23:20,240 --> 00:23:22,000
I still have rehearsal this afternoon.

347
00:23:25,030 --> 00:23:27,200
I'm okay now, Mom.

348
00:23:27,400 --> 00:23:29,240
Really. Don't worry.

349
00:23:29,480 --> 00:23:30,240
Are you really fine?

350
00:23:30,750 --> 00:23:31,400
Really.

351
00:23:32,440 --> 00:23:32,880
Okay.

352
00:23:33,510 --> 00:23:34,270
Your call.

353
00:23:41,440 --> 00:23:42,110
Excuse me.

354
00:23:42,400 --> 00:23:43,960
Has anyone found a wallet?

355
00:23:44,480 --> 00:23:46,240
I bought a ticket here yesterday.

356
00:23:46,350 --> 00:23:46,790
What?

357
00:23:47,070 --> 00:23:48,550
(Box Office)
Has anyone found a wallet?

358
00:23:48,920 --> 00:23:49,790
I lost it.

359
00:23:50,880 --> 00:23:52,000
I don't understand you.

360
00:23:53,030 --> 00:23:53,680
Vincent.

361
00:23:54,350 --> 00:23:55,720
I think she lost the wallet.

362
00:23:55,920 --> 00:23:56,720
Let me check.

363
00:23:58,590 --> 00:23:59,160
Hello.

364
00:24:00,550 --> 00:24:02,030
Have you lost a wallet?

365
00:24:02,440 --> 00:24:03,270
Yes.

366
00:24:03,590 --> 00:24:04,830
What color is it?

367
00:24:05,400 --> 00:24:06,960
It's a green wallet.

368
00:24:07,480 --> 00:24:08,640
- Green wallet?
- Yes.

369
00:24:09,350 --> 00:24:10,400
Is it yours?

370
00:24:16,590 --> 00:24:19,240
You must've waited here for so long.

371
00:24:19,550 --> 00:24:20,440
No problem.

372
00:24:20,720 --> 00:24:22,070
What a kind girl.

373
00:24:22,640 --> 00:24:24,590
Your English is so good.

374
00:24:25,720 --> 00:24:27,000
Thank you so much.

375
00:24:34,510 --> 00:24:36,550
(So this is what respect feels like.)

376
00:24:37,880 --> 00:24:39,590
(So to earn respect,)

377
00:24:40,110 --> 00:24:41,030
(you don't fight)

378
00:24:41,550 --> 00:24:42,590
(or prove yourself.)

379
00:24:44,070 --> 00:24:46,070
(You just do what you know is right.)

380
00:24:49,880 --> 00:24:50,680
(Vincent.)

381
00:24:52,070 --> 00:24:52,750
(Thank you.)

382
00:24:54,880 --> 00:24:56,160
(Thanks for always being here.)

383
00:24:59,750 --> 00:25:00,640
(I used to think)

384
00:25:01,550 --> 00:25:03,070
(I'd lost everything.)

385
00:25:03,920 --> 00:25:05,110
(That I could only survive.)

386
00:25:06,510 --> 00:25:07,750
(But now I see.)

387
00:25:08,310 --> 00:25:10,830
(I'm young, smart, and healthy.)

388
00:25:11,440 --> 00:25:13,350
(Why can't I fight for my own life?)

389
00:25:17,320 --> 00:25:18,600
(English Practice Test)

390
00:25:20,880 --> 00:25:22,440
(I'm still taking the entrance exam.)

391
00:25:22,440 --> 00:25:23,440
(English Practice Test)

392
00:26:05,110 --> 00:26:06,920
That poor girl Su Lin.

393
00:26:07,270 --> 00:26:08,480
With parents like that...

394
00:26:09,310 --> 00:26:10,680
Page 0918.

395
00:26:10,920 --> 00:26:11,510
Call back.

396
00:26:12,030 --> 00:26:12,550
Thanks.

397
00:26:22,510 --> 00:26:23,310
What are you doing?

398
00:26:27,070 --> 00:26:27,720
I'm asking you.

399
00:26:27,750 --> 00:26:28,400
What is this?

400
00:26:29,590 --> 00:26:30,590
I'm going down there.

401
00:26:30,920 --> 00:26:31,920
Into the drain?

402
00:26:32,920 --> 00:26:33,310
Yeah.

403
00:26:35,440 --> 00:26:37,070
That girl said

404
00:26:37,110 --> 00:26:38,240
she already went down.

405
00:26:38,830 --> 00:26:39,680
She didn't find her.

406
00:26:39,830 --> 00:26:41,480
Even if Su Lin fell in,

407
00:26:41,590 --> 00:26:43,000
maybe she climbed back out.

408
00:26:43,240 --> 00:26:43,790
Besides,

409
00:26:43,880 --> 00:26:45,110
those drains go everywhere.

410
00:26:45,240 --> 00:26:47,030
You'll be searching blind down there.

411
00:26:47,680 --> 00:26:49,160
Can't you wait for Tai Wei to call

412
00:26:49,270 --> 00:26:50,270
and let the cops handle it.

413
00:26:50,920 --> 00:26:51,720
Come on, Gu.

414
00:26:51,960 --> 00:26:53,510
You already called it in.

415
00:26:53,960 --> 00:26:55,240
I'm waiting on them.

416
00:26:56,270 --> 00:26:57,880
I'll fill Tai Wei in first.

417
00:26:58,350 --> 00:26:59,510
But Su Lin...

418
00:26:59,590 --> 00:27:00,640
I can't just sit here.

419
00:27:02,400 --> 00:27:03,640
I need to go look myself.

420
00:27:04,750 --> 00:27:05,590
It's been days.

421
00:27:06,030 --> 00:27:07,680
If she's really down there,

422
00:27:08,720 --> 00:27:09,550
how would she live?

423
00:27:10,070 --> 00:27:11,920
Maybe she already got out.

424
00:27:12,240 --> 00:27:13,310
Why didn't she go home?

425
00:27:14,030 --> 00:27:14,680
Where is she?

426
00:27:20,200 --> 00:27:21,070
Fill this with water.

427
00:27:43,720 --> 00:27:44,790
Page 0918.

428
00:27:44,920 --> 00:27:45,680
Call back ASAP.

429
00:27:46,000 --> 00:27:46,550
Thanks.

430
00:27:54,920 --> 00:27:56,000
(Chaobei Police Bureau)
Zhang Yanhua.

431
00:27:56,240 --> 00:27:58,000
Male, 35.

432
00:27:58,880 --> 00:28:00,590
Divorced. Lives alone.

433
00:28:01,790 --> 00:28:04,200
Photographer for Close Friends magazine.

434
00:28:05,070 --> 00:28:07,790
Disciplined once for solicitation.

435
00:28:09,270 --> 00:28:10,550
Looks-wise,

436
00:28:10,790 --> 00:28:11,680
he's presentable.

437
00:28:12,550 --> 00:28:13,550
He's one of our targets.

438
00:28:14,240 --> 00:28:14,960
Write it down.

439
00:28:15,790 --> 00:28:17,720
Check the vehicle registry

440
00:28:17,750 --> 00:28:19,000
for any car in his name.

441
00:28:44,160 --> 00:28:44,830
Wang.

442
00:28:45,680 --> 00:28:46,270
Wang!

443
00:28:49,030 --> 00:28:49,830
This punk.

444
00:28:50,200 --> 00:28:51,110
Makes his boss work

445
00:28:51,270 --> 00:28:52,480
while he sleeps like a baby.

446
00:28:52,510 --> 00:28:53,240
Hey, don't.

447
00:28:54,640 --> 00:28:55,680
He was up all night.

448
00:28:57,680 --> 00:28:58,880
What's up?

449
00:28:59,680 --> 00:29:00,880
Got good news.

450
00:29:01,240 --> 00:29:02,200
What?

451
00:29:02,350 --> 00:29:03,240
Finally retiring?

452
00:29:03,480 --> 00:29:04,720
You're the one retiring.

453
00:29:05,350 --> 00:29:06,110
Listen.

454
00:29:06,440 --> 00:29:08,440
I just got back from

455
00:29:09,070 --> 00:29:09,790
Institute No. 2.

456
00:29:09,880 --> 00:29:11,640
I trained in DNA testing.

457
00:29:12,790 --> 00:29:13,680
DNA testing,

458
00:29:14,000 --> 00:29:14,880
you heard of that?

459
00:29:15,270 --> 00:29:16,070
Yeah.

460
00:29:16,440 --> 00:29:18,030
Paternity tests, right?

461
00:29:18,350 --> 00:29:18,880
Right.

462
00:29:19,270 --> 00:29:20,880
Now we can use it in criminal cases.

463
00:29:21,960 --> 00:29:22,750
Remember

464
00:29:22,790 --> 00:29:24,590
the semen I recovered

465
00:29:24,790 --> 00:29:25,880
from those three victims?

466
00:29:26,270 --> 00:29:28,000
Our lab could only tell

467
00:29:28,030 --> 00:29:29,510
it came from type A blood.

468
00:29:29,920 --> 00:29:32,070
To find the killer,

469
00:29:32,440 --> 00:29:34,440
we'd have to screen dozens, maybe 100.

470
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:36,200
Who did it? We couldn't tell.

471
00:29:36,480 --> 00:29:37,350
Check them all.

472
00:29:37,880 --> 00:29:38,400
But

473
00:29:38,880 --> 00:29:40,350
with DNA testing,

474
00:29:40,640 --> 00:29:42,720
we can pinpoint one person.

475
00:29:43,110 --> 00:29:43,920
One person.

476
00:29:44,750 --> 00:29:46,550
Just like a fingerprint?

477
00:29:46,680 --> 00:29:48,640
That's DNA fingerprinting.

478
00:29:49,270 --> 00:29:49,880
Anyway,

479
00:29:50,000 --> 00:29:51,110
if you've narrowed down

480
00:29:51,270 --> 00:29:52,640
your suspect pool,

481
00:29:52,920 --> 00:29:53,960
just draw their blood.

482
00:29:54,270 --> 00:29:56,310
I'll send it
to the provincial police lab.

483
00:29:57,240 --> 00:29:58,920
After training with Institute No. 2,

484
00:29:58,960 --> 00:30:00,440
they can run DNA now.

485
00:30:00,720 --> 00:30:01,550
Perfect.

486
00:30:02,000 --> 00:30:04,000
We solve this, dinner's on me.

487
00:30:04,200 --> 00:30:05,030
For real?

488
00:30:05,200 --> 00:30:06,480
Every time you invite me out,

489
00:30:06,550 --> 00:30:07,310
I end up paying.

490
00:30:07,350 --> 00:30:09,200
You better mean it.

491
00:30:17,920 --> 00:30:18,920
Someone's at the door.

492
00:30:21,160 --> 00:30:21,720
Coming.

493
00:30:26,400 --> 00:30:26,920
Mr. Gu.

494
00:30:30,640 --> 00:30:32,000
Su's still inside.

495
00:30:32,240 --> 00:30:33,750
I said I was taking out the trash.

496
00:30:33,790 --> 00:30:35,590
Can we talk?

497
00:30:36,750 --> 00:30:37,400
Come in.

498
00:30:41,400 --> 00:30:41,920
Sit.

499
00:30:41,920 --> 00:30:42,480
Mr. Gu.

500
00:30:42,640 --> 00:30:43,000
Sit.

501
00:30:43,030 --> 00:30:43,680
Mr. Gu.

502
00:30:43,920 --> 00:30:44,750
What are you doing?

503
00:30:44,960 --> 00:30:46,400
Thank you for today.

504
00:30:46,550 --> 00:30:47,240
Mr. Gu,

505
00:30:47,310 --> 00:30:48,790
I can't thank you enough.

506
00:30:48,880 --> 00:30:50,030
Mrs. Su, please get up.

507
00:30:50,270 --> 00:30:51,480
Promise me something first.

508
00:30:51,550 --> 00:30:52,350
Then I'll get up.

509
00:30:52,440 --> 00:30:53,750
Get up, then I'll promise.

510
00:30:53,880 --> 00:30:55,270
- Please, get up.
- Promise me.

511
00:30:55,270 --> 00:30:55,830
Get up.

512
00:30:55,830 --> 00:30:56,640
No other choice.

513
00:30:56,640 --> 00:30:57,240
Come sit.

514
00:30:57,310 --> 00:30:57,920
Sit. Talk.

515
00:30:58,510 --> 00:30:59,440
Tell me. Sit.

516
00:30:59,590 --> 00:31:00,960
I'm begging you.

517
00:31:01,680 --> 00:31:03,640
Please help us find Lin.

518
00:31:04,640 --> 00:31:06,510
I know she's still alive.

519
00:31:09,720 --> 00:31:11,310
Mrs. Su, tell me the truth.

520
00:31:11,350 --> 00:31:11,920
Okay.

521
00:31:12,240 --> 00:31:13,070
You and Su-

522
00:31:13,270 --> 00:31:14,880
You can't blame her dad.

523
00:31:15,240 --> 00:31:17,400
We have our reasons too.

524
00:31:17,480 --> 00:31:18,590
No, what I'm asking is...

525
00:31:19,550 --> 00:31:21,550
About what happened to Lin,

526
00:31:22,240 --> 00:31:23,590
you and Su both know, don't you?

527
00:31:27,720 --> 00:31:29,000
You're afraid to look for her

528
00:31:29,880 --> 00:31:30,920
because of Ma Dongchen.

529
00:31:31,030 --> 00:31:31,640
Yes.

530
00:31:32,400 --> 00:31:33,160
He threatened you?

531
00:31:33,240 --> 00:31:34,310
He did.

532
00:31:34,350 --> 00:31:35,550
And he lied to us.

533
00:31:35,790 --> 00:31:37,200
He forced us.

534
00:31:37,350 --> 00:31:38,640
He's making us move.

535
00:31:39,110 --> 00:31:40,070
So when Lin comes back,

536
00:31:40,110 --> 00:31:41,590
she won't find us.

537
00:31:41,720 --> 00:31:42,480
She won't find

538
00:31:42,550 --> 00:31:43,880
her own home.

539
00:31:45,480 --> 00:31:47,310
He's a horrible man.

540
00:31:47,400 --> 00:31:49,200
At first he told us

541
00:31:49,510 --> 00:31:51,590
the girls just had a little fight.

542
00:31:51,640 --> 00:31:52,480
Who knew they'd

543
00:31:52,480 --> 00:31:55,270
do something that cruel to her?

544
00:31:55,350 --> 00:31:56,920
They went too far.

545
00:31:57,110 --> 00:31:58,680
How did Ma Dongchen threaten you?

546
00:31:59,550 --> 00:32:00,000
Wait.

547
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:00,960
If he threatened you,

548
00:32:01,000 --> 00:32:02,350
you can go to the police.

549
00:32:02,480 --> 00:32:03,830
We can't.

550
00:32:03,880 --> 00:32:05,160
It's gone too far.

551
00:32:05,350 --> 00:32:06,750
If we call the police,

552
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:10,310
my husband will go to prison.

553
00:32:10,590 --> 00:32:11,400
Ma Dongchen told you that?

554
00:32:11,440 --> 00:32:12,070
Yes.

555
00:32:15,200 --> 00:32:15,880
Mrs. Su.

556
00:32:16,110 --> 00:32:17,880
I know this isn't my place,

557
00:32:18,270 --> 00:32:20,310
but how could you do this to your child?

558
00:32:20,590 --> 00:32:21,510
We were wrong.

559
00:32:21,550 --> 00:32:23,160
We know we were wrong.

560
00:32:23,830 --> 00:32:25,270
Lin's such a good girl.

561
00:32:25,440 --> 00:32:28,240
She deserved a better family.

562
00:32:29,510 --> 00:32:30,110
Mrs. Su.

563
00:32:30,400 --> 00:32:31,200
I promise.

564
00:32:31,790 --> 00:32:32,550
I promise.

565
00:32:33,590 --> 00:32:34,880
Thank you, Mr. Gu.

566
00:32:35,030 --> 00:32:35,960
I'll look for her.

567
00:32:37,030 --> 00:32:38,200
I need to ask you something.

568
00:32:39,640 --> 00:32:40,880
If I bring her home,

569
00:32:42,270 --> 00:32:43,160
then what?

570
00:32:43,400 --> 00:32:44,480
You tell me.

571
00:32:50,400 --> 00:32:51,920
We'll figure it out.

572
00:33:01,960 --> 00:33:03,720
As long as Lin is alive,

573
00:33:03,960 --> 00:33:04,400
then

574
00:33:04,640 --> 00:33:06,510
we'll find a way.

575
00:33:06,750 --> 00:33:07,110
We'll

576
00:33:07,310 --> 00:33:08,440
take it one step at a time.

577
00:33:08,920 --> 00:33:11,070
We'll deal with things as they come.

578
00:33:11,350 --> 00:33:12,960
There'll be a way.

579
00:33:17,030 --> 00:33:18,000
Mr. Gu.

580
00:33:24,680 --> 00:33:25,510
Mr. Gu.

581
00:33:30,160 --> 00:33:30,640
Then

582
00:33:31,830 --> 00:33:33,270
thank you.

583
00:33:33,510 --> 00:33:34,270
Don't thank me.

584
00:33:35,590 --> 00:33:36,880
I'm not doing it for you.

585
00:33:38,270 --> 00:33:40,030
She's my friend.

586
00:33:41,480 --> 00:33:42,110
Go home.

587
00:33:46,550 --> 00:33:47,310
You're a good man.

588
00:33:47,960 --> 00:33:48,720
Mr. Gu.

589
00:34:06,310 --> 00:34:07,640
They want us to find her,

590
00:34:07,790 --> 00:34:09,150
then won't take care of her?

591
00:34:09,510 --> 00:34:11,440
That family is hopeless.

592
00:34:12,320 --> 00:34:13,360
I'm going to see Tai Wei.

593
00:34:22,400 --> 00:34:23,230
Slow down.

594
00:34:23,480 --> 00:34:24,230
Easy.

595
00:34:28,320 --> 00:34:29,150
(Chaobei Police Bureau)
No time.

596
00:34:29,230 --> 00:34:30,360
We got city approval

597
00:34:30,760 --> 00:34:31,760
for a forensic lab

598
00:34:31,800 --> 00:34:33,590
to help process samples here.

599
00:34:34,360 --> 00:34:35,070
Stay in line.

600
00:34:35,070 --> 00:34:36,000
Officer, our turn?

601
